        </article>

        <!-- 场景 2：工具站/付费墙画布 + 右上角悬浮 Popup 弹窗高仿真 Chrome 窗口 -->
        <article class="nl-sim-scene">
          <div class="nl-sim-caption">
            <span class="nl-sim-badge">{l('场景 2 · 工具站/付费墙站内救场', 'Scene 2 · Inside Any Tool or SaaS Website')}</span>
            <h3>{l('网页画布零遮挡；遇到强制登录或导出付费墙时，点右上角角标秒换免登录方案', 'Zero canvas clutter—click the toolbar score badge to bypass signup walls with top alternatives')}</h3>
          </div>

          <div class="nl-chrome-window" role="region" aria-label={l('工具网站浏览器工具栏角标与弹出面板仿真窗口', 'Simulated SaaS website with browser toolbar badge and extension popup')}>
            <div class="nl-chrome-omnibar">
              <div class="nl-chrome-lights" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cl-r"></span><span class="cl-y"></span><span class="cl-g"></span></div>
